      "side": 1,
      "message": "LGTM for the change. and it\u0027s nice that it removes additional special casing, but does this actually work as is in `dawn::wire`? Is the handle valid across processes?",
      "revId": "e2a37277fb36c2dc7dc90f8412d3881b8645912d",
