      "writtenOn": "2026-03-10T18:40:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just for my understanding, that effectively means that the client will need access to the file system right? I don\u0027t think that will work in Chrome out of the box? What is this being used for then? Basically trying to understand more context for this change.",
